T1  - Reinforcement Learning-Driven Multimodal Medical Foundation Model for Unified Understanding, Reasoning and Generation
AU  - Chen, W.
AU  - Xing, L.
JO  - International Journal of Radiation Oncology*Biology*Physics
VL  - 126
